  "body": "Viewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\n49 King Edward Parade commands breathtaking harbour views across to Orakei, offering an exceptional waterfront lifestyle in a home where timeless design meets uncompromising quality.\r\n\r\nCompleted in 2015, this meticulously crafted residence captures the elegance of a classic villa while delivering the comfort, efficiency and low-maintenance ease of modern construction. Every detail has been thoughtfully considered, from premium finishes to practical design.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 321sqm, the home features generous, light-filled living spaces designed for both relaxed family living and effortless entertaining. The upper level living area is a standout, with soaring vaulted ceilings, expansive harbour views and seamless flow to a covered deck with a fully equipped outdoor kitchen. A lift provides convenient access between levels.\r\n\r\nPractical features include a triple-car garage with a vehicle turntable for easy access.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Swim, kayak or stroll along the waterfront just across the road, with three popular cafes within walking distance. Offering the perfect balance of coastal tranquillity and city convenience, with the CBD only a short commute away, this is a rare opportunity to secure an exceptional waterfront home and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JFWR",
